<body>
    <!-- Carriage Accounting System section beign -->
    <section @*data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-once="true"*@>
        <div class="slider-txt text-center product-sec-1">
            <h1>Carriage Accounting System</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="product-sec-2 mt-4">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-7 col-md-6 col-sm-6 prod-cont mt-md-5 mt-lg-5 mt-xl-5 mb-sm-3 mb-3">
                        <h4>TAKE A LOOK AROUND OUR PRODUCT</h4>
                        <p>In publishing and graphic design, lorem ipsum is a placeholder text commonly used to demonstrate the visual form of a document without relying on meaningful content. Replacing the actual content with placeholder text allows designers to design the form of the content before the content itself has been produced.</p>
                        <a href="#"><span class="product-read-more-bttn text-center text-xl-left text-lg-left text-md-left">READ MORE</span></a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-5 col-md-6 col-sm-6 prod-img">
                        <img src="~/images/security-Icon-1.png">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <!-- Carriage Accounting System section end -->
    <!-- Carriage Accounting System features section begin -->
